10,0$Please notice that the key is not binary. There are, in other words, often more than two alternatives, and one should check all before making the choice. The key contains many references between the subgenera. For example, certain species that lead to Sericeocybe in the main key, are later referred to Phlegmacium./// Sometimes the stipe measurement is used to distinguish between slender and robust species. It is then a question of the diameter of the upper part of the stipe on most mature specimens in a collection.


